# ==========================================
# Policy with Intentional Errors
# Demonstrates compiler diagnostics & error handling
# ==========================================

# Error 1: Port out of range (99999 > 65535)
RULE RULE_BAD_PORT
WHEN TCP PORT 99999
IF SOURCE ANY
THEN ALLOW

# Error 2: Unsupported protocol (FTP is application layer, not transport)
RULE RULE_BAD_PROTOCOL
WHEN FTP PORT 21
IF SOURCE ANY
THEN BLOCK

# Error 3: Duplicate rule identifier
RULE RULE_BAD_PORT
WHEN UDP PORT 53
IF SOURCE ANY
THEN ALLOW

# Error 4: Invalid ICMP port specification
RULE RULE_BAD_ICMP
WHEN ICMP PORT 8080
IF SOURCE ANY
THEN ALLOW
